  pages:
  - heading: Apreel 1
    body: 'Dear dairee


      Mark pushd me in the mud today. He sed my dol was
      dum so then I hid his red train in the fridge. He cryd and Dad got mad..'
  - heading: Apreel 5
    body: 'Der diaree


      mom really likes flowers theres always flowers around
      and it smells relly nice. mommy say unky likes them too. Unky stayed for dinner'
  - heading: Ayprul 9
    body: 'Dear dairy


      Unky frank came again when daddy was not hom. mommy
      said to go to our room to play because the gowrn ups will talk but i think
      unky yell'
  - heading: Ayprul 12
    body: 'Diarree


      I drew white flwrs for my drawing class and miss camille
      sed that it was a very Pretty Flower. mommy put the Flower on the fridge and
      then mark cryed'
  - heading: Ayprul 31
    body: 'Weeee!!! Kids partee


      Dino piza is my favourite pizza ever. Unky
      Franky came with us and played with us and jumped with us but he got really
      tired. He was asking mommy to go home but we stayed hehe we won!'
  - heading: May 16
    body: 'Dear diaree


      Im in my room now becos mommy said mark and i should
      play in the room when unky is here but i wanted the flowers he brought so im
      angry i dont have the flows'
  description: A small diary. Belongs to Maria Rivera. There's lots of stories, doodles
